cff-version: 1.2.0
message: "If you use GuardLens in academic or technical work, please cite it as below."
title: "GuardLens: RAG-native security analytics for autonomous agent audit logs"
abstract: >-
  GuardLens ingests the JSONL audit trail of an autonomous agent's permission
  gate, computes DuckDB-backed metrics, retrieves evidence with hybrid
  BM25 + dense retrieval and cross-encoder reranking, answers questions with
  verified citations, routes statistics through guarded read-only SQL, and
  evaluates the whole pipeline on a golden set.
authors:
